-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 1. Prior rigidity & REBUS relaxation
-- A cognitive prior / latent-inhibition filter restricts candidate associations H to `P : H → Type`.
-- `PriorRelaxed P Q` states that Q relaxes P (every P-admitted hypothesis remains Q-admitted).
PriorRelaxed : {H : Type} → (H → Type) → (H → Type) → Type
PriorRelaxed {H} P Q = (h : H) → P h → Q h
